@startuml
title UC-010 Clean up the activity log
start
:An administrator turns on the clean-up and sets the time;
:The task is turned on;
:Once a day the task starts;
:Read where the log is clean up to;
repeat :Take one day of the log;
  :Read the ids of the entries of the plugin, a thousand at once;
  :Delete them by their ids;
  :Write down how far it got;
repeat while (Older than the time kept and time left?) is (yes)
stop
@enduml
